  "title": "Ricky W Probable NDE 4892",
  "date": "1960",
  "content": "I tried to rescue an eight year old friend of mine from drowning, and he took me down under the water. He was too strong for me, and I thought that I was drowning, or that maybe I was dead. I began to see a bright, yellowish light and feel that if this was death, it was very peaceful and wonderful. One of my feet found a rock, and then my head came out from under the water, and I was totally rejuvenated. Ever since that incident, I always wondered if I was dead and was brought back by God. I have never experienced the bright light before. I had never heard about it on television or other media sources. I do thank God because maybe I was dead, and he put the rock there.",
